{"title":"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In an experiment, a scientific constant <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is determined to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/e/e6e3159bd4b58e19630916398a2dd2f0ec742463.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2.43865$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> with an error of at most <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/7/ba78379dcbb99356c86c70bd0a185a46d2f588cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pm 0.00312$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"72\" height=\"13\" />. \nThe experimenter wishes to announce a value for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> in which every digit is significant. \nThat is, whatever <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is, the announced value must be the correct result when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is rounded to that number of digits. \nThe most accurate value the experimenter can announce for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/2/402ea95c69caaf9dca322c331ed629035f478c2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 2.4\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 2.43\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 2.44\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 2.439$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"441\" height=\"17\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If added together, we have:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/d/2ad276e17b73c0bf5493e845f1e6e8c8cb0e446d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2.43865+0.00312=2.44177\\]\" width=\"224\" height=\"14\" />\nThis rounds to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/a/7da2f18d8a435e1504879b48c423437e335a040b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2.44$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"32\" height=\"12\" />. If they subtracted, we have:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/4/074ee5805842c7b4fdac50684dc0b37a215f1e55.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2.43865-0.00312=2.43553.\\]\" width=\"227\" height=\"13\" />\nThis rounds to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/a/7da2f18d8a435e1504879b48c423437e335a040b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2.44$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"32\" height=\"12\" />. Therefore, we have the answer to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/a/66aac0e9e114838458b87eb3602de31565a70c17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{\\textbf{(D)} 2.44}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"76\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME\" title=\"1988 AHSME\">1988 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1988 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1988\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Prob